* CABSRT16 - SUSPENSE CONSOLIDATION FOR THE AGEING REPORT
* MVT OS/360 SORT/MERGE FORM OF JCL/CTLCARDS/CABSRT16.
* MERGES FOUR GENERATIONS OF THE SUSPENSE FILE AND REMOVES EXACT
* DUPLICATES.  A RECORD THAT WAS RECYCLED AND SUSPENDED AGAIN
* APPEARS ON TWO GENERATIONS WITH THE SAME CONTENT EXCEPT FOR
* THE RUN ID, SO THE DUPLICATE TEST AS FILED EXCLUDES THE
* RUN ID FIELD.  THE KEY BELOW IS THE COMPARE - 1,4 ERROR CODE,
* 6,8 DETECTING PROGRAM, 14,30 DETECTING PARAGRAPH AND 56,200
* THE ORIGINAL RECORD.  THE RUN ID AT 44 IS NOT IN IT.
*
* THE RULE THAT LEFT THIS CARD
*   THE SUM FIELDS NONE OPERAND IS NOT CODED HERE.  THIS SORT HAS
*   NO SUM STATEMENT.  THE E35 EXIT CABSXDUP NOW COMPARES THE
*   FOUR KEY FIELDS BETWEEN THE HELD RECORD AND THE INCOMING ONE
*   AND DELETES THE INCOMING ONE ON A MATCH.
*
* OPTION EQUALS IS NOT CODED - THIS SORT HAS NO OPTION
* STATEMENT.  THIS IS THE STEP WHERE THAT MATTERS.  THE ORIGINAL
* CARD RELIED ON EQUALS TO LEAVE RECORDS WITH THE SAME KEY IN
* MERGE INPUT ORDER, WHICH IS OLDEST GENERATION FIRST, SO THAT
* THE FIRST OF A DUPLICATE PAIR CARRIED THE OLDEST RUN ID.
* CABSXDUP NOW GUARANTEES THAT ORDERING INSTEAD - IT HOLDS ITS
* CANDIDATE, READS THE CYCLE DATE OUT OF THE RUN ID OF EVERY
* MEMBER OF THE GROUP, AND KEEPS THE OLDEST ONE WHATEVER ORDER
* THE EQUAL KEYS ARRIVE IN.
*   THE AGEING REPORT THEREFORE SEES THE OLDEST RUN ID AND THE
*   AGE IT REPORTS IS THE AGE OF THE FIRST SUSPENSION, NOT THE
*   MOST RECENT ONE.  THAT IS AGREED AND IS WHY THE OLDEST
*   ITEM LIST IS WORTH LOOKING AT.
*
* THE DUPLICATE RULE AND THE CHOICE OF SURVIVOR ARE NO LONGER
* READABLE FROM THIS CONTROL CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(1,4,CH,A,6,8,CH,A,14,30,CH,A,56,200,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(300)
 MODS E35=(CABSXDUP,16384,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
